(AN,"The mitral and tricuspid valves are anchored to the fibrous skeleton at their:","Annuli",["Chordae","Papillary muscles","Leaflet tips"],"The annuli also separate atria from ventricles electrically.","F"),
(C,"Before starting an echo, the sonographer explains the exam mainly to:","Gain informed cooperation and reduce anxiety",["Save time","Avoid using gel","Change the frame rate"],"Explain what the patient will feel and how long it takes.","F"),
